  "title": "Reinforcement Learning \u2014 a CNN policy that sees pixels",
  "description": "PPO learns to steer a dot to its target from a 21\u00d721 picture. Two strided convolutions read the image and a dense layer turns it into features; stable-baselines3 adds the action and value heads. Try replacing the convolutions with Flatten + Dense to see why policies that look at pixels need them."
 },
